I've got three days. That's more than enough.

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.570
No matter what you say,
three days are too short to learn...

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:56.870
If I can't learn, I'll withdraw from Kaleido Stage!

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.710
Hello. Rosetta!

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:02.610
