as Rosetta would call me Master.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:29.070
I was born in Belgium and studied in France.

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:32.340
You're supposed to be my guide, but
you don't know anything about me, do you?

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:35.470
I demand a satisfactory explanation
from you in the dressing room!

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:38.910
Back then, you used to call me a guide.

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:41.180
Sorry. I was young.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:43.150
Um, you're still young...

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:46.290
Anyway, my first goal
is to do the Golden Phoenix.

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.490
Well... Anyway, why don't we give it a try?

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:52.760
