00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:51.690
Only one more day left until the time limit.

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:54.520
We don't have time to goof off!

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.860
The trapeze?

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:57.980
