00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.400
That's why she is going to give me
special training.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:01.860
That's right. Special training.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.030
What? What?

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:04.900
Rosetta is going to do the trapeze?

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:07.200
And Sora will be your teacher?

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:09.230
Both of those things might be hopeless...

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:14.440
If a beginner has to be able to perform in three
days, I'm sure it will be super-special training.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.150
Last time, I was your ruthless coach.

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:19.710
But you can be my ruthless coach this time.

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.420
