00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:25.210
Please train me rigorously, Master Sora!

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:27.860
Rigorous special training, huh?

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:31.830
In that case, we'll get Sora to give us special
training in how to be gag characters.

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:32.830
Right, Ken?

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.000
