Let me see, let me see.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.860
What is this?! It looks great!

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:37.860
See? See?

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.260
How about "Rosetta Set-ta The Bar Too High"?

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:41.060
That is very pretty.

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:44.460
How about if we put something like
"Rosetta Fell Into the Net-ta"?

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.810
You look tired.

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:51.810
No...

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:53.880
Have you been practicing all the time
ever since then?

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:54.770
Yes.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.600
Or how about "Rosetta ls..."

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:58.010
Hey, Rosetta!

00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:59.100
Rosetta?

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:00.620
Oh, no!

00:13:00.620 --> 00:13:01.450
Shush.

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:03.750
She's all right. Just sleeping.

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:04.740
Sleeping?

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:07.080
"Rosetta Went to Bed-da"!

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:11.260
She's been building up fatigue even before this,
adjusting to a dorm life she's not used to.

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:14.200
Maybe it's better if we just let her
take a rest like this today.

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:15.130
Okay.

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:17.830
And, I just heard this from Rosetta,

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:22.060
but she says she's never even
been on a park swing before.

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.800
What?

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:31.350
What time is it now?

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:32.810
Oh, no! I overslept!

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:38.280
Sora?

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:43.520
"l have the show today,
so we'll do the rest tomorrow."

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:45.730
"We'll go to a secret special training place,

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:48.520
so rest well until then. Sora."

00:13:56.670 --> 00:14:00.010
Sora is in the middle of the show right now.

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:01.880
I can't just keep sleeping.

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:04.780
There is only one day left until I have
to make good on my promise.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:15.160
Sora, where's this secret special training place?

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.180
It's the elementary school that Marion attends.

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:20.430
You're not saying we're
practicing on kiddie swings?

00:14:20.430 --> 00:14:22.120
I already got the teacher's permission.

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:25.120
Are you looking down on me, Sora?

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:27.360
I'm serious about this.

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:30.840
They said I was a good pick because I was
ready to appear on the stage immediately,

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:33.310
but all I'm doing is causing everybody trouble.

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:40.310
As it is now, my coming to Kaleido Stage is
meaningless, despite the opposition from Mom.

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:43.280
Marion, it's a little early,
but why don't we have lunch?

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:44.350
Okay.

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:46.320
You too, Rosetta. Okay?

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:51.790
Okay, Jonathan!

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:55.050
Rosetta, I hear you've never been on a swing?

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:58.320
Yes. I've never played in the park.

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:03.040
Since I was little, I've been
practicing diabolo the whole time.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:06.030
I spent day and night on the stage every day.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:11.240
As for me, I first rode a swing
by myself when I was three.

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:17.410
Of course, I never thought about wanting to
appear on stage, I was just playing.

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:19.620
Playing?

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:21.720
At first, you can take your time.

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:23.250
So, let's think of this as playing.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:25.630
But, I made a promised to the Boss.

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:27.500
Here.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:30.000
It's herb tea. It makes you relax.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.070
Oh, thank you.

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:34.360
Hey! No fair! Me too!

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:35.540
Leaving the Boss aside,

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:36.740
Give me some.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:36.740
Leaving the Boss aside,

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:39.300
I want to see what our trapeze
performance might look like together.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:44.040
I want to see what our diabolo
performance might look like together.

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:47.040
Me too.

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:49.450
Okay.

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:52.540
Thank you, Sora.

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:55.020
Now, let's get going!

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:55.860
Okay.

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:56.820
We're going!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:02.630
The one we can see over there
is Marion's school?

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:04.060
Yep. Isn't it big?

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.500
They are small.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:09.870
What?! These are great swings!

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:10.870
That's right.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:12.030
Let's play, Jonathan.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:15.530
Here!

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:20.410
Why don't we also get on a swing?

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.080
What? Okay.

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:25.290
First of all, you have to be able to
rock the swing.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:26.450
Okay.

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:27.760
Now, have a seat.

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.310
Okay.

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:32.380
Rosetta!

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:35.120
Sorry, are you okay?

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:38.130
Sora, are you tired of me?

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:39.370
You're not sick of this?

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:41.270
Not, at all.

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:44.030
You've stopped liking me, huh.

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:46.170
Oh, it's true!

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:47.870
Master Rosetta!

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:49.610
What? Me?

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:51.510
Wow, she's the real thing!

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:53.240
She is younger than I thought.

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:56.340
Let me introduce my friends.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:57.790
I'm Maria.

00:16:57.790 --> 00:16:59.220
I'm Ben. Nice to meet you.

00:16:59.220 --> 00:16:59.590
They say they want you to teach them juggling.

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:00.620
I'm Andy.

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:00.620
They say they want you to teach them juggling.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.750
They say they want you to teach them juggling.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:04.850
What?

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:06.760
I'm Maggie.

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:10.700
We're thinking about doing a juggling show
for our friend's birthday party.

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.190
But we can't do it well.

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.870
We watched a magician's video and practiced.

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:18.640
You're also specialized in juggling,
aren't you Rosetta?

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:19.870
Oh, yes.

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:21.940
The party is tomorrow.

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:23.110
Please teach us.

00:17:23.110 --> 00:17:24.940
Please on my behalf too.

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:26.510
Okay.

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:28.610
First, please show me your juggling.

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.520
Yay!

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:34.890
The one we're going to do is bouncing balls.

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:37.860
We're going to bounce balls on the
ground and juggle them.

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:40.120
We will use three balls.

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:41.620
Ready, go!

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:46.490
Sheesh...

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.500
Good, good.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:52.110
All you guys are much better than I am.

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:54.040
What? Really?

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:56.940
We can't perform like this!

00:17:56.940 --> 00:18:01.470
When I started, I had a hard time
handling even two balls well.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.580
So, all you guys have
the makings of a good juggler.

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:06.210
Wow. You guys were praised by a genius girl.

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:07.960
Everyone, do your best!

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:09.460
Sora, you too. Let's practice together.

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:11.050
What?

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:14.960
Okay, then I'll start teaching you one at a time.

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:18.900
If you stay calm and patient,
I'm sure all of you will improve.

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:24.310
Do this rhythm, one, two, three.
Now, one, two, three.

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:26.300
One, two, three. One, two, three.

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:28.800
I think I'm getting better.

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:31.540
The most important thing is rhythm.

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:37.180
Oh, Sora. You're worse than Jonathan.

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:41.420
Everyone, you got a lot better.

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:48.230
I practiced every day and
I still can't do it.

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:51.700
Master!

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:53.500
Move your hands the way I move mine.

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:57.040
Don't be impatient. Relax your shoulders.

00:18:57.040 --> 00:18:58.040
Okay.

00:18:58.040 --> 00:19:00.340
One, two, three. One, two, three.

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:01.740
One, two, three. One...

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:04.680
Wow! I can do it.

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:06.110
I can do it!

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:07.450
You can't be impatient.

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:10.010
When you try too hard, it's hard
to get into the rhythm, isn't it?

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:13.020
One, two, three. One, two, three.

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:14.190
I see.

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:14.190
One, two, three. One, two, three.

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:18.450
I was also being impatient with myself
for only being able to do the diabolo.

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:18.450
One, two, three. One, two, three.

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:23.200
That's all I can teach you.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:26.100
The thing you need to do is to
practice by yourself until tomorrow.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.530
Thank you!

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:30.800
Excuse me, Master, but is it true that
you can't swing on the swings?

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:32.930
Hey, it's rude to ask her something like that!

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:35.040
It's true.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:38.940
And if I cannot learn how to get on a swing
by today, I have to quit Kaleido Stage.

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:40.480
What?!

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:41.480
Are you serious?

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:42.570
It's not true, is it?

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:45.290
I'll teach you.

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:46.790
Put your butt down like this,

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.920
and rock your body back and forth.

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:50.360
Then, you will be perfect.

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:53.260
Thank you, Andy.

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:55.490
Then, let's have you try it!

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:58.400
Here, Rosetta, have a seat right here.

00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:00.400
It's your turn this time, Rosetta.

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:02.470
Rosetta, don't be impatient.

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.200
Relax your shoulders.

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:06.070
Your body's rhythm is the important thing!

00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:07.940
I know what to do.

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:09.140
Yeah!

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:12.080
Please teach me.

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:15.140
Here, sit down, sit down.

00:20:16.050 --> 00:20:17.880
Let me take charge of your body.

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:19.750
Okay, here I go.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:20.750
Now!

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:22.190
Wait, Sora!

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:27.420
I saw Kaleido Stage.

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:28.800
Where, where?

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:29.830
Behind us.

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:30.930
I can't see it.

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:32.870
I saw it a second ago.

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:34.770
I think I didn't swing enough.

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:37.300
Then, let's swing more!

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:40.240
Go! Go way up!

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:42.540
Look!

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:44.310
It's true.

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:45.780
Rosetta...

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:47.010
What, Sora?

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:49.640
You're the one rocking
the swing now, you know.

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:50.990
No way.

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:52.650
I'm not doing anything.

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:55.920
Amazing. I was able to rock the swing.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:59.550
But, I know this is not good enough for Kalos.

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.260
Don't worry. I'll go apologize to him with you.

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:03.250
Thank you, Sora.

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:07.190
We'll be together all the time, Sora.

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:10.140
I couldn't keep the promise.

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:11.660
I'm sorry, Boss.

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:16.070
I don't remember any promise.

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:19.970
I promised that I was going to withdraw
if I couldn't learn the trapeze in three days.

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:22.040
Oh, that.

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:24.280
So, I need to withdraw?

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:25.290
Rosetta...

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:26.320
Three years!

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:26.720
What?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:27.990
Excuse me?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:27.990
What?

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:31.580
Rosetta, I expect you to be the top star
of the trapeze three years from now.

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:34.190
Then...

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:39.370
The things you were talking about on the phone,
I don't remember I agreed with you.

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:40.800
Sora... I'm...

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:41.800
Isn't this great?

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:43.570
We're able to appear on stage together.

00:21:44.140 --> 00:21:45.110
I'm so happy!

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:47.980
Don't relax your efforts, you two.

00:21:47.980 --> 00:21:49.410
Don't skip a practice.

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:51.110
Three years will fly by before you know it.

00:21:52.610 --> 00:21:56.220
Of course, I intend to practice
the trapeze very hard.

00:21:56.220 --> 00:21:59.340
So, I won't be able to do my diabolo show
more than three times a week.

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:02.190
Are you serious?

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:04.090
I am serious, Boss.

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:06.260
Let's go, Sora.

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:07.750
Oh, then. Excuse us.

00:22:12.270 --> 00:22:13.400
Three years from now,

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:16.800
I'll do the legendary great maneuver
with Sora for sure!

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:20.640
Rosetta's already started
walking with her own feet.

00:22:20.640 --> 00:22:23.710
In order to be a real Kaleido Star,

00:22:23.710 --> 00:22:29.010
I also have to start walking forward!
Forward! Forward!

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:34.960
<i>All kinds of hard luck flocks your way
as if it's spurring you on</i>

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:34.960
<i>Sekasu you ni muragaru Hard luck</i>

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:38.190
<i>Swept away by it, time is over</i>

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:38.190
<i>Nagasarete Time is over</i>

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:42.000
<i>Just as it was predicted, take it easy</i>

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:42.000
<i>Yokoku douri Take it easy</i>

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:46.430
<i>I will get you out right away</i>

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:46.430
<i>Tsuredasu yo imasugu</i>

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:48.140
<i>Hurry up (Here we go)</i>

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:48.140
<i>Hurry up (here we go)</i>

00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:50.100
<i>Forcibly only (Drive with the fastest speed)</i>

00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:50.100
<i>Gouin only (saisoku drive)</i>

00:22:50.100 --> 00:22:53.370
<i>The view I look down at every day is the best</i>

00:22:50.100 --> 00:22:53.370
<i>Nichijo miorosu best view</i>

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:55.810
<i>Sunset point (Favorite)</i>

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:55.810
<i>Sunset point (favorite)</i>

00:22:55.810 --> 00:22:57.710
<i>Harbor light (Stormy night)</i>

00:22:55.810 --> 00:22:57.710
<i>Harbor light (stormy night)</i>

00:22:57.710 --> 00:23:01.510
<i>Escape for the sake of tomorrow</i>

00:22:57.710 --> 00:23:01.510
<i>Asuno tame ni escape</i>

00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:08.190
<i>Even I don't have a vacation,
I've got an oasis</i>

00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:08.190
<i>Bakansu nashi demo oashisu wa get</i>

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:14.620
<i>I'll turn off the cell phone
and charge my love</i>

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:14.620
<i>Keitai off tte ai o charge shite</i>

00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:19.470
<i>Because some pain,
you can't soothe with just kindness</i>

00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:19.470
<i>Yasashisa dake ja iyasenai itami mo aru kara</i>

00:23:19.470 --> 00:23:23.330
<i>We are alone. We pass each other</i>

00:23:19.470 --> 00:23:23.330
<i>We are alone. Surechigau</i>

00:23:23.770 --> 00:23:24.740
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:23.770 --> 00:23:24.740
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:30.000
<i>At the far end of regret,
I encounter my true heart</i>

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:30.000
<i>Koukai no hate ni deau true heart</i>

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:37.380
<i>Whether I'm crying or laughing,
I will be with you</i>

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:37.380
<i>Naite mo waratte mo I'll be with U</i>

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:42.820
Next Kaleido Star: New Wings

00:23:43.360 --> 00:23:44.490
Miss Layla...

00:23:44.490 --> 00:23:45.650
Sora!

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:49.330
And so, I'm going to co-star
with that Miss Layla?!

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:50.730
Wait for a second!

00:23:51.230 --> 00:23:53.530
I'll be the one to pair with Miss Layla!

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:56.570
Oh, May, please don't get in my way.

00:23:56.570 --> 00:23:58.870
I wanted see you Miss Layla.

00:23:58.870 --> 00:23:59.840
Layla! Layla!

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.540
Next time Kaleido Star,
"The Ever Amazing Miss Layla"

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:05.780
The Ever Amazing Miss Layla

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:05.780
Next time Kaleido Star,
"The Ever Amazing Miss Layla"

00:24:05.780 --> 00:24:08.380
The Ever Amazing Miss Layla

00:24:05.780 --> 00:24:08.380
My wings are my dream
and on towards the sky...

